  Slug: hired-killer
  DisplayName: Hired Killer
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Your life truly began after your first kill. Maybe you killed in self-defense,
    maybe it was a crime of passion, or maybe it was just an accident and you were
    a kid in the wrong place at the wrong time. In the end, the why doesn't matter.
    You got away with it. And then you found that maybe it didn't bother you as much
    as it should have. And maybe, just maybe, you had a talent you could use to forge
    a life for yourself. A blood-soaked talent and a blood-soaked life, sure. But
    it's yours. Choose two attribute boosts. One boost must be to Strength or Dexterity
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Stealth skill and
    the Underworld Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Terrain
    Stalker] skill feat, choosing a terrain appropriate for where you make your kills.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Guns & Gears
